            </h2>
            
            <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-stone-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10 reveal leading-relaxed font-light">
                Visit <strong>Dr. Khan's Clinic</strong> in Keshawapur for expert medical care. We treat routine illnesses, diabetes, and provide full body checkups with patience and care.
